cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this database, please cite it using the metadata below.
  Cite the version DOI of the release you used: the data changes between
  releases, so only a version DOI lets others reproduce a result.
title: "Martialis: Martial Arts Lineage Database"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Muñoz
    given-names: Frederico
    email: fsm@martial.is
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9488-3542"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Martial-IS/martialis-db"
url: "https://martial.is"
abstract: >-
  Martialis is a sourced database of martial arts lineages:
  teacher/student transmission, document-based knowledge transmission,
  and rank and honor claims, each carrying its own cited evidence and
  confidence assessment. Records are authored as YAML, converted to RDF
  through a JSON-LD context, and validated with SHACL and an OWL 2 DL
  consistency check.
keywords:
  - martial arts
  - linked data
  - RDF
  - lineage
  - SHACL
  - genealogy
license:
  - AGPL-3.0-or-later
  - CC-BY-SA-4.0
  - CC0-1.0
license-url: "https://github.com/Martial-IS/martialis-db/blob/main/LICENSING.md"
identifiers:
